1
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,200
Hello.

2
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,399
I'm from Zhao's Construction.

3
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:55,159
My name is Zhou Qian.

4
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,439
Mr. Zhao sent me over to—

5
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,439
Mr. Ma, right?

6
00:00:57,799 --> 00:00:59,119
Sorry to keep you waiting.

7
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:00,600
This way, please.

8
00:01:01,159 --> 00:01:02,520
Here for me?

9
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,000
That Chairwoman Shen...

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,719
didn't just hear my voicemail

11
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,680
and start lusting after my eight-pack, did she?

12
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:12,439
What's the matter, Boss Ma?

13
00:01:12,799 --> 00:01:14,400
Weren't you full of swagger just now?

14
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,319
Now that you hear she's waiting upstairs,

15
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,400
you got weak in the knees?

16
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,840
Who's weak in the knees?

17
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:21,400
Let's go, Big Sis.

18
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,680
I'll show you the big leagues.

19
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:24,920
Me?

20
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:27,959
Manager Zhou,

21
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:30,400
not only do I not have an appointment,

22
00:01:31,040 --> 00:01:32,079
they even sent someone to escort me.

23
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:33,799
This big corporation's rules

24
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,799
don't seem to be quite what you said.

25
00:01:48,719 --> 00:01:49,239
After you.

26
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,239
Let go!

27
00:01:58,719 --> 00:02:00,159
Go see your financial backer yourself.

28
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,640
Why drag me up here?

29
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,439
Didn't you say

30
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,080
Chairwoman Shen is into wild stuff?

31
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,240
If she tries anything on me,

32
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,319
you can shield me.

33
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:13,879
To repay your kindness,

34
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,120
I'll give you two

35
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,159
limited-edition dresses from our factory.

36
00:02:19,159 --> 00:02:20,199
Aren't you afraid

37
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:22,439
I might help Chairwoman Shen

38
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,599
pin you down?

39
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,240
Big Sis,

40
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,719
you can't repay kindness with betrayal!

41
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,400
Then let go of me already!

42
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,280
No way.

43
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:31,840
At least you're on my side.

44
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:32,960
You have to stay with me.

45
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:48,479
Linna,

46
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,840
when is Chairwoman Shen coming?

47
00:02:50,199 --> 00:02:51,039
How much longer do I have to wait?

48
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,319
I'm sorry, Mr. Ma.

49
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:55,439
Chairwoman Shen is completely tied up right now.

50
00:02:55,439 --> 00:02:56,240
She can't step away.

51
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:58,639
I'm afraid she can't meet with you today.

52
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:06,360
Big corporate bosses love putting on airs.

53
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:08,000
Is leaving people hanging that fun?

54
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,039
Yes.

55
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,639
Chairwoman Shen's intention is...

56
00:03:10,879 --> 00:03:11,560
to leave you hanging.

57
00:03:14,199 --> 00:03:16,159
Big deal just because you're filthy rich?

58
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:17,840
Giving me a show of force, huh?

59
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:18,879
Fine.

60
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:20,039
You keep me waiting,

61
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:22,639
and I'll use this time to dig up all your dirt!

62
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,199
Fine.

63
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,199
Since Chairwoman Shen is so busy,

64
00:03:27,199 --> 00:03:28,719
there's no need to waste any more time.

65
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:32,879
My time is worth millions a minute too.

66
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,520
Big Sis, let's go. We're leaving.

67
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,719
You go ahead.

68
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,439
You dragged me all the way here earlier.

69
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:40,960
I'm heading to the restroom to touch up.

70
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:43,400
Alright then.

71
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,479
Linna,

72
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,639
please let Chairwoman Shen know

73
00:03:50,919 --> 00:03:51,719
that I, Ma Dawei,

74
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:54,240
won't be someone she can see on a whim!

75
00:04:04,159 --> 00:04:05,719
His visit today was so sudden.

76
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,759
Why did he suddenly bring up

77
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:08,639
a partnership with you?

78
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,840
It was quite sudden.

79
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:12,439
Judging by what he was hinting at,

80
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,000
he must have recently made

81
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,680
a fortune in the stock market.

82
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:17,319
Otherwise, he wouldn't be this confident.

83
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,360
The stock market?

84
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,600
Him?

85
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,279
Chairwoman Shen,

86
00:04:21,439 --> 00:04:23,000
the market is bleeding terribly right now.

87
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,720
So many institutions are losing money.

88
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:27,199
What if he fell victim to fleecing

89
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,800
and is just bluffing in front of you?

90
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,399
I actually don't think he's bluffing.

91
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,480
Since you think so highly of him,

92
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,360
why don't you just tell him

93
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:37,759
you're the Chairwoman Shen he wants to see?

94
00:04:38,959 --> 00:04:39,959
If he knew

95
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,480
that I'm the untouchable

96
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:43,279
Chairwoman of Yunding Group,

97
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:45,319
would he still be around me

98
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,120
in such a carefree way?

99
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:52,920
It doesn't matter if he knows right now.

100
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,680
By the way,

101
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:56,480
are Zhao Gang's two watchdogs in the lobby

102
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,279
still there?

103
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:57,639
They're still there.

104
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,959
Zhao Gang called earlier to beg you

105
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,959
for the honor of having dinner tonight.

106
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,639
Since we unilaterally cut ties with him,

107
00:05:04,399 --> 00:05:06,439
the loan sharks he borrowed from

108
00:05:06,639 --> 00:05:07,680
caught wind of it as well.

109
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:08,759
They're all camped outside his door.

110
00:05:08,879 --> 00:05:10,120
He sent those two over

111
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,360
most likely regarding this issue.

112
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:12,839
Tell them

113
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,240
I'll be there tonight.

114
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,439
She said she'll be arriving shortly.

115
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,560
Chairwoman Shen, you're here.

116
00:05:39,759 --> 00:05:40,399
Chairwoman Shen has arrived!

117
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,399
Chairwoman Shen!

118
00:05:44,639 --> 00:05:45,120
Chairwoman Shen!

119
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:45,879
Having you here...

120
00:05:45,879 --> 00:05:47,680
...is truly a huge honor for me.

121
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,759
Please, have a seat!

122
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,040
Aren't you...

123
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,319
...that woman?

124
00:05:56,519 --> 00:05:57,199
What are you babbling about?

125
00:05:58,399 --> 00:05:59,160
Shut up!

126
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,199
Chairwoman Shen,

127
00:06:03,519 --> 00:06:04,319
my apologies.

128
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:05,439
She doesn't know how to speak properly.

129
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:10,759
What are you standing around for?

130
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,439
Pour the wine!

131
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,000
Chairwoman Shen,

132
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,120
it's an honor to meet you.

133
00:06:25,920 --> 00:06:27,279
I hope in the future

134
00:06:27,279 --> 00:06:29,480
I'll have the chance to learn from you.

135
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:37,199
Since Deputy Manager Zhou is so capable,

136
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,079
does she really need to learn from me?

137
00:06:43,759 --> 00:06:44,839
What is going on, Zhou Qian?

138
00:06:48,040 --> 00:06:49,160
Chairwoman Shen!

139
00:06:49,439 --> 00:06:51,040
I was completely blind!

140
00:06:51,279 --> 00:06:53,399
I failed to recognize a VIP like you!

141
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:56,839
It's all Zhou Qian's fault!

142
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,360
It's entirely her fault!

143
00:06:58,560 --> 00:07:00,040
She had to put on airs in front of you!

144
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:02,120
I... I was misled!

145
00:07:02,759 --> 00:07:04,079
Please, be generous...

146
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:06,279
...and just let a blind fool like me go!

147
00:07:07,439 --> 00:07:08,160
Mr. Zhao,

148
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,639
you probably don't know this yet,

149
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,160
but earlier, Deputy Manager Zhou

150
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,959
was kind enough to give me some advice.

151
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,720
She said an old woman like me,

152
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,920
carrying a knockoff no-brand bag,

153
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,920
might be a bit older,

154
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,600
but looks decent enough...

155
00:07:20,879 --> 00:07:22,720
...and insisted I join your company

156
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:24,639
for an easy gig as a receptionist.

157
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:25,839
Mr. Zhao,

158
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,279
it seems you usually

159
00:07:27,279 --> 00:07:30,000
give Deputy Manager Zhou a lot of nerve.

160
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:32,240
Making her think all women in the world

161
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,519
must sell themselves

162
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,399
just to find shelter from the storm.

163
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,040
You bitch!

164
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,439
You arrogant piece of trash!

165
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:47,240
Since the company expensed a few outfits,

166
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,160
you throw your weight around out here?

167
00:07:51,319 --> 00:07:52,680
Who the hell do you think you are?

168
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,680
How dare you disrespect Chairwoman Shen?!

169
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,040
My deepest apologies, Chairwoman Shen.

170
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:01,759
Please don't lower yourself

171
00:08:01,759 --> 00:08:02,720
to the level of these rude underlings.

172
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,600
Her? What "deputy manager"?!

173
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:08,279
She was just a special hire

174
00:08:08,279 --> 00:08:08,920
to entertain our clients!

175
00:08:09,199 --> 00:08:10,680
At best, she's just a trophy

176
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,040
to keep up appearances,

177
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:12,879
a drinking escort!

178
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,079
Chairwoman Shen,

179
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:23,839
there must be a misunderstanding here.

180
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:25,639
I had absolutely no intention

181
00:08:25,639 --> 00:08:27,199
to offend Yunding Group!

182
00:08:29,279 --> 00:08:30,240
I'll drink three glasses as a penalty!

183
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,519
Mr. Zhao,

184
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,759
I'm not particularly fond of

185
00:08:34,799 --> 00:08:36,879
having this kind of 'special hire' around.

186
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,360
It's foul,

187
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,200
and hurts efficiency.

188
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:46,440
Chairwoman Shen...

189
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,440
I graduated from a top university, too!

190
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,360
I handle legitimate business!

191
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:51,879
I didn't...

192
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:52,559
Is that so?

193
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,240
A real professional

194
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,240
doesn't spend their energy

195
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:58,559
teaching others to be a high-end escort.

196
00:09:00,879 --> 00:09:03,480
Keep your petty schemes to yourself.

197
00:09:03,879 --> 00:09:04,799
Someone like you

198
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,399
doesn't even belong at this table.

199
00:09:11,639 --> 00:09:12,879
Why the hell are you still standing there?

200
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,799
Didn't you hear Chairwoman Shen?

201
00:09:15,039 --> 00:09:15,840
Get the hell out!

202
00:09:26,720 --> 00:09:27,600
And you.

203
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,240
You get the hell out, too.

204
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:29,039
Yes, right away.

205
00:09:29,120 --> 00:09:30,120
I'll get out right now.

206
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,240
Chairwoman Shen,

207
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:39,759
no need to get mad over someone like that.

208
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,799
I'll take three penalty drinks.

209
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:41,799
What gives you the right?

210
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,279
Just because you're rich and powerful,

211
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,320
you get to act high and mighty

212
00:09:44,519 --> 00:09:45,679
and walk all over me?

213
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,279
We're both women!

214
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,759
Why?!
